# AI-Powered Solutions - Business Website

A modern, responsive, and feature-rich business website for showcasing AI-assisted coding services. This website offers website and app development services with integrated AI capabilities.

## 🚀 Features

### Core Sections
- **Homepage**: Vibrant hero section with call-to-action buttons and business metrics
- **About Us**: Company vision, value proposition, and team information
- **Services**: Comprehensive service offerings with icons and descriptions
- **Pricing**: Six pricing tiers with detailed feature lists
- **Testimonials**: Carousel showcasing client reviews with 5-star ratings
- **Contact**: Form with validation, payment options, and Google Maps integration

### Unique Features
1. **Project Cost Estimator**: Interactive tool for real-time project cost calculation
2. **AI Recommendation System**: Smart assistant to suggest the best package based on business needs
3. **Chatbot Widget**: AI-powered demo chatbot for instant assistance
4. **Business Metrics Counters**: Animated counters showing 150+ projects, 5-day turnaround
5. **Scroll Animations**: Smooth AOS animations throughout the site
6. **Responsive Design**: Fully optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+)
- **Framework**: Bootstrap 5.3.2 for responsive layout
- **Icons**: Font Awesome 6.4.2
- **Animations**: AOS (Animate On Scroll) Library
- **External APIs**: Google Maps for location embed

## 📁 Project Structure

```
Business-website/
├── index.html          # Main HTML file
├── css/
│   └── style.css      # Custom styles
├── js/
│   └── script.js      # Interactive functionality
├── images/            # Image assets (if needed)
├── assets/            # Additional assets
└── Readme            # Project documentation
```

## 🎨 Design Highlights

- **Modern Color Scheme**: Purple gradient theme with professional aesthetics
- **Smooth Animations**: On-scroll animations for better user engagement
- **Interactive Elements**: Hover effects, transitions, and dynamic content
- **Accessibility**: Semantic HTML and ARIA labels where applicable
- **SEO Optimized**: Meta tags, semantic structure, and clean code

