## 📝 Customization Guide

### Colors
Edit CSS variables in `style.css`:
```css
:root {
    --primary-color: #6366f1;
    --secondary-color: #8b5cf6;
    --dark-color: #1f2937;
}
```

### Content
Edit text directly in `index.html`

### Pricing
Update pricing cards in the pricing section

### Services
Modify service cards in the services section

